Subject: [PATCH] Molten Core: the tank re-takes the Majordomo adds it held after Teleport Target

WHY THIS PATCH EXISTS

Majordomo Executus casts Teleport Target (20534) on his victim every 30
seconds, and the victim is the tank: it is thrown into the fire pit and the
Flamewaker Healers (11663) and Flamewaker Elites (11664) it held turn on the
raid. The moltencore strategy returns early for tank target selection, so
nothing tells the tank to go back for them, and stock tank selection can pick
Majordomo himself. This is patch 4 of 4 for the encounter and builds on
patches 0017, 0018 and 0019, which edit the same function. The context of the
hunk below deliberately spans the kill order block of patch 0019, so the patch
cannot apply to a tree that lacks the earlier ones.

WHAT IT DOES

For tank target selection only, while a Flamewaker add is attacking a player
who is not a tank (a "loose" add), Majordomo himself and every add whose
current victim is a tank are excluded. The tank's own selection then takes
the nearest loose add, taunts it and holds it. Teleport Target leaves no
aura on its victim, so the loose add, which is what the teleport leaves
behind, is the observable key; the spell id is named here and in the tests.
The exclusion is recomputed on every call and ends the moment no add is loose,
so tank selection goes back to the stock one and a tank is never left without
a target. Majordomo is excluded only while an add is loose, so a tank is not
pulled onto him while the raid is being eaten. The fork's old early return
for tanks is narrowed to the area-target case.

WHAT THIS PATCH DELIBERATELY DOES NOT DO

It does not touch the reflect hold (patch 0017), the Damage Shield step-off
(patch 0018) or the kill order (patch 0019). Damage and area target
selection for non-tanks is unchanged. It keys on the two add entries by id, so
no other encounter is affected. Nothing here was compiled or run: the fork
build is not available where this was written, and a live Majordomo run
confirms it.

WHEN THIS PATCH SHOULD BE DELETED

When the fork's Molten Core strategy re-establishes the tank's threat on the
Majordomo adds itself.

